@SportMatch_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Create a game to join
POST {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "footballFieldId": 1,
  "createdByUsername": "lukas",
  "startTime": "2027-01-01T18:00:00Z",
  "maxPlayers": 10
}

### Join a game
POST {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/join?id=2&username=tautvydas

### Leave a game
POST {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/leave?id=2&username=tautvydas

### Get free spots of a game
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/spots?id=2
Accept: application/json
